    <statement><p>Simplify and write the following in exponential notation. If</p>
<p><me>\frac{ x^{ \frac{2}{9} } ~u^{ \frac{4}{9} }  }{ x^{ -\frac{6}{9} }    u^{ \frac{1}{18} } } = x^{m} \cdot u^n</me></p>
<p>then</p>
<p><m>m =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/>
    and    
<m>n =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>{\frac{8}{9}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>{\frac{7}{18}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
